              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Harqood",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Qoriga lagu xidho laba dibi inay wax ku jiidaan.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harqoodkayga dushiinna ku qaata oo wax iga barta; waayo, waan qaboobahay, qalbigayguna waa hooseeyaa, oo naftiinna nasashaad u heli doontaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
